  "dcterms:description": "The 'eutoxrisk-temposeq' brick builds a tabular dataset from EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq targeted RNA-sequencing gene-expression data retrieved from the EdelweissData platform (api.develop.edelweiss.douglasconnect.com, Douglas Connect; published dataset id d8922983-1724-4ce8-af07-93f290d9c3c2, filtered to 'EUT' EU-ToxRisk files), combined with pathway data: the WikiPathways gene set (WikiPathway_2023_Human) obtained via the Enrichr geneSetLibrary endpoint at maayanlab.cloud. The EU-ToxRisk source data has no license statement in the repository or on the (development) EdelweissData API endpoint.",
